      "user_id": 55320,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767662174133331
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm very sorry to hear you're having trouble with your VeloBand. Just so I understand correctly, what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 402,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767662179933331
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a technical fault. It's broken. The pulse reader won't sync, and half the time it shows zero. It's a defective unit. I don't have time to troubleshoot. Can you process a return, yes or no?",
